                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ripple is a fun and engaging puzzle game that offers the perfect balance between simplicity and challenge. The minimalistic design makes it easy to understand the mechanics and jump straight into solving puzzles, while the increasing difficulty keeps the experience interesting and rewarding. I really like how the game encourages logical thinking, patience, and problem-solving without overwhelming the player with unnecessary features. Whether you're a casual player looking for a relaxing experience or an achievement hunter aiming to complete everything, Ripple has something to offer. It's a great game for anyone who enjoys testing their mind and improving their skills one puzzle at a time. Definitely worth checking out!",
